<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/fullds.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tokens.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/redesign.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/notifications.css" />
    <script src="/js/notifications.js" defer></script>
    <title>Register | Chikios</title>
  </head>
  <body class="register-page">
    <div class="page-shell">
      <aside class="story-panel" aria-label="Welcome to Chikios">
        <div class="story-background" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="story-overlay"></div>
        <div class="story-content">
          <a class="brand brand-light" href="/" aria-label="Kidz Quest home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/images/logo.png" alt="Kidz Quest" /></a>
          <div class="story-copy">
            <span class="story-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span>2026 NYC KidzQuest</span>
            <h1>Let the<br /><em>fun</em> begin<span class="heading-dot">!</span></h1>
            <p>Let’s get your kiddo ready for church.</p>
            <div class="story-badge"><span aria-hidden="true">☀</span> MADE FOR LITTLE ADVENTURERS</div>
          </div>
          <p class="story-footer">A happy place for every little face <span aria-hidden="true">✿</span></p>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <main class="registration-main">
        <div class="mobile-brand"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Kidz Quest home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/images/logo.png" alt="Kidz Quest" /></a><span>LET’S GET STARTED <span aria-hidden="true">✦</span></span></div>
        <div class="registration-content">
          <div class="form-topline"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> EVENT REGISTRATION</span><span class="little-sparkle" aria-hidden="true">✦</span></div>
          <h2 class="page-title">Child Info<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2>
          <p class="page-intro">Give us just few little details, and they’ll be ready right away!</p>
          <div class="event-note"><span class="event-note-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><div><strong>A little heads-up</strong><p>Doors open at 6:30 PM &nbsp;·&nbsp; Pickup is at 9:00 PM</p></div></div>
          <div class="select-registrant-alert" role="status">Please review the child's details and make sure your phone number is correct.</div>
          <section id="form-data" aria-label="Registration details">
            <input type="text" id="img-url" hidden />
            <input type="text" id="attendance" name="attendance" value="GMC.2025" hidden />
            <input type="text" id="id" name="id" hidden />
            <div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><h3>About your kiddo</h3><p>Tell us a little about your child.</p></div><span class="section-art" aria-hidden="true">✿</span></div>
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="field autocomplete-field"><label for="fn">First name</label><input type="text" placeholder="e.g. Charlie" class="form_input" id="fn" autocomplete="given-name" oninput="filterRegistrants()" onblur="handleBlur()" onfocus="handleFocus()" /><div class="registrants-dropdown"><% registrants.forEach(function(registrant) { %><button type="button" data-registrant="<%= JSON.stringify({ first_name: registrant.first_name, last_name: registrant.last_name, age: registrant.age, gender: registrant.gender, guardian_first_name: registrant.guardian_first_name, guardian_last_name: registrant.guardian_last_name, guardian_phone_number: registrant.guardian_phone_number, guardian_id: registrant.guardian_id, attendance: registrant.attendance, id: registrant.id }) %>" onclick="chooseRegistrant(JSON.parse(this.dataset.registrant))"><p data-value="<%= registrant.first_name %> <%= registrant.last_name %>"><%= registrant.first_name %> <%= registrant.last_name %></p></button><% }); %></div></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="ln">Last name</label><input type="text" placeholder="e.g. Parker" class="form_input" id="ln" autocomplete="family-name" /></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="age">Age <span class="label-hint">(4–11 years)</span></label><input type="number" placeholder="Their age" class="form_input-number" id="age" max="11" min="4" /></div>
              <div class="field"><span class="field-label" id="gender-label">Gender</span><div class="gender-options" role="group" aria-labelledby="gender-label"><input type="number" id="gender" name="gender" value="0" hidden /><button type="button" id="malebtn" aria-pressed="false" onclick="handleGender(1, 'malebtn')">Boy</button><button type="button" id="femalebtn" aria-pressed="false" onclick="handleGender(2, 'femalebtn')">Girl</button></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="section-heading guardian-heading"><span class="section-number section-number-coral">02</span><div><h3>About their grown-up</h3><p>So we can keep in touch with you.</p></div><span class="section-art section-art-coral" aria-hidden="true">♡</span></div>
            <input type="text" id="gid" name="guardian_id" value="" hidden />
            <div class="form-grid">
              <div class="field"><label for="gfn">First name</label><input type="text" placeholder="Your first name" class="form_input" id="gfn" autocomplete="given-name" /></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="gln">Last name</label><input type="text" placeholder="Your last name" class="form_input" id="gln" autocomplete="family-name" /></div>
              <div class="field field-full"><label for="gphone">Phone number</label><input type="tel" placeholder="Your best contact number" class="form_input" id="gphone" autocomplete="tel" /><p class="field-help">We’ll use this number to contact you if needed.</p></div>
            </div>
            <label class="sms-consent"><input type="checkbox" id="sms-consent" /><span>I agree to receive Kidz Quest registration codes, pickup reminders and staff texts at this number. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help. Consent is optional.</span></label>
            <p class="policy-links">Read our <a href="/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> and <a href="/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a> (opens in a new tab).</p>
            <button type="button" class="register-button" id="register-btn" onclick="handleRegister()"><span>Let’s get registered</span><span class="button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
            <p class="form-footnote"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Almost time to make some memories!</p>
          </section>
        </div>
        <footer class="page-footer"><span>MADE WITH <span class="footer-heart">♥</span> FOR LITTLE ADVENTURES</span><nav aria-label="Footer links"><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="/login">Staff login ↗</a></nav></footer>
      </main>
    </div>